<title>UK: UK's Sherwood sees H2 profits below H1.</title>
<headline>UK's Sherwood sees H2 profits below H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British lingerie maker Sherwood Group Plc said on Tuesday it expected pre-tax profits for the second half to be &quot;appreciably less&quot; than the 3.75 million stg the company reported in the first half.</p>
<p>Sherwood said the forecast included exceptional reorganisation costs for the full year of 3.1 million stg, of which 800,000 stg was taken in the first half.</p>
<p>Sherwood's shares were marked down 15p at 43 1/2 at 0806 GMT.</p>
</text>
